t-fc7a065\" data-id=\"fc7a065\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4515c3c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4515c3c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Building With Excellence<br \/><\/span><strong>Across Central Oregon<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2e405f2 elementor-section-full_width elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2e405f2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-30f8a1c\" data-id=\"30f8a1c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f39b85b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f39b85b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"485\">At Harris &amp; Sons, we\u2019re proud to bring our trusted construction and remodeling expertise to communities throughout Central Oregon. With a reputation built on quality craftsmanship, integrity, and personalized service, our team is dedicated to helping homeowners bring their visions to life.<\/p><p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"669\">Whether you\u2019re planning a home addition, a custom remodel, or a new construction project, we provide reliable solutions designed to fit your lifestyle and exceed your expectations.<\/p><p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"734\">We proudly serve homeowners across Central Oregon, including:<\/p><ul data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"832\"><li data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"748\"><p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"748\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-bend\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Bend, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"764\"><p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"764\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-redmond\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Redmond, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"780\"><p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"780\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-sisters\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Sisters, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"797\"><p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"797\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-sunriver\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Sunriver, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"816\"><p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"816\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-prineville\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Prineville, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"832\"><p data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"832\"><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-la-pine\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">La Pine, OR<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-elemen